From cb851d257ad63e926fec55536a0385465f9afce5 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: fozzfut <vanolia13@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 27 Sep 2026 02:07:28 +0700
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] PartDesign: Chamfer saves ReferenceFaces with the
 document

Review of the consistent-face change: ReferenceFaces was transient, so a
document reopened from disk had an empty record until the chamfer was
recomputed. The task panel then placed the Size gizmo by the old
topology-order fallback - on the other face than the one the stored result
was measured on - and tools reading the record showed nothing. The record is
now saved like any output property; nothing is written on restore.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 src/Mod/PartDesign/App/FeatureChamfer.cpp | 2 +-
 src/Mod/PartDesign/App/FeatureChamfer.h   | 3 ++-
 2 files changed, 3 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/src/Mod/PartDesign/App/FeatureChamfer.cpp b/src/Mod/PartDesign/App/FeatureChamfer.cpp
index f189e88..1245cb7 100644
--- a/src/Mod/PartDesign/App/FeatureChamfer.cpp
+++ b/src/Mod/PartDesign/App/FeatureChamfer.cpp
@@ -122,7 +122,7 @@ Chamfer::Chamfer()
         ReferenceFaces,
         (),
         "Chamfer",
-        App::PropertyType(App::Prop_Output | App::Prop_Transient | App::Prop_ReadOnly),
+        App::PropertyType(App::Prop_Output | App::Prop_ReadOnly),
         "EdgeN:FaceM per chamfered edge: the base face Size and Angle are measured on"
     );
 
diff --git a/src/Mod/PartDesign/App/FeatureChamfer.h b/src/Mod/PartDesign/App/FeatureChamfer.h
index 92382cf..b318fdd 100644
--- a/src/Mod/PartDesign/App/FeatureChamfer.h
+++ b/src/Mod/PartDesign/App/FeatureChamfer.h
@@ -51,7 +51,8 @@ public:
     /// "Legacy": the first adjacent face in the shape's topology order (FlipDirection: the last),
     /// FreeCAD 1.1 / 26.3 stock; documents saved without this property keep it.
     App::PropertyEnumeration ReferenceMode;
-    /// Output, not saved: "EdgeN:FaceM" per chamfered edge (base shape numbering), the face that
+    /// Output, saved with the document so that the task panel has it before any recompute:
+    /// "EdgeN:FaceM" per chamfered edge (base shape numbering), the face that
     /// Size and Angle are measured on. Empty for "Equal distance".
     App::PropertyStringList ReferenceFaces;
 
